# Portfolio Global Rules

## Monorepo

- `portfolio-frontend/` — public site (edit for UI)
- `portfolio-admin/` — CMS dashboard
- `portfolio-backend/` — Spring Boot API
- `portfolio-deploy-kit/` — private deploy backup (never push secrets)

## Secrets

Never commit: `.env`, `recovered/`, `application-dev.properties`, `application-prod.properties` with real values.

## Production URLs

- Site: https://ragingscout97.in
- Admin: https://admin.ragingscout97.in
- API: https://portfolio-api.ragingscout97.in/api

## Workflow

- One section per session; verify with `ng build` in `portfolio-frontend`
- Content comes from API — do not hardcode profile/projects data in templates
- See root `AGENTS.md` for full context
